#: templates/admin/migration/wizard/step3_preview.html:262
msgid ""
"Spwig imports your data one item at a time, and each item is saved as it is "
"imported. If the import stops part way through, the items already imported "
"stay in your store unless you tick the option above. You can roll an import "
"back at any time from the Migrations list — whether it finished, failed or "
"was stopped. Rollback removes what the import added, but keeps anything your "
"store has since come to depend on, such as an imported product that now "
"appears on a real customer's order. Take a full backup before you begin."
msgstr ""
"Spwig mengimpor data Anda satu item demi satu, dan setiap item disimpan saat "
"diimpor. Jika proses impor berhenti sebelum selesai, item yang sudah diimpor "
"akan tetap ada di toko Anda, kecuali Anda centang opsi di atas. Anda dapat "
"mengembalikan (rollback) impor kapan saja dari daftar Migrations — apakah "
"impor tersebut selesai, gagal, atau dihentikan. Rollback menghapus apa yang "
"telah ditambahkan oleh impor, tetapi tetap mempertahankan hal-hal yang toko "
"Anda telah bergantung padanya, seperti produk yang diimpor yang kini muncul "
"dalam pesanan pelanggan nyata. Ambil cadangan penuh sebelum Anda memulai."

